p-flash-image.\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"path\\\":{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Absolute local filesystem path for the analysis target; relative paths are rejected.\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"provider_id\\\":{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Exact deep-analysis provider ID, or automatic selection when omitted.\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"snapshot_path\\\":{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Absolute local filesystem path for the analysis snapshot; relative paths are rejected.\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"path\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"}}\\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\\n\"}\n27: {\"step_index\":27,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T22:55:38Z\",\"thinking\":\"Initial assessment reveals several RPF files and a binary file. The presence of an executable file, specifically `game_scarlett_master.exe`, is confirmed within an XML layout file, included within a \\\"content\\\" source path. This suggests the primary focus is likely on the executable and its associated content.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"find_by_name\",\"args\":{\"Extensions\":\"[\\\"exe\\\",\\\"bin\\\",\\\"rpf\\\",\\\"xvd\\\",\\\"xml\\\"]\",\"Pattern\":\"\\\"*\\\"\",\"SearchDirectory\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\<user>\\\\\\\\Downloads\\\\\\\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Searching files by extensions\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Find files by extension\\\"\"}}]}\n28: {\"step_index\":28,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T22:55:45Z\",\"content\":\"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:55:45-05:00\\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:55:45-05:00\\nFound 68 results\\nCatalog000.bin\\nanim.rpf\\nappdata0.rpf\\nappxmanifest.xml\\naudio.rpf\\ncommon.rpf\\ndata\\ndata/ttdb\\ndata/ttdb/graphics\\ndata/ttdb/interiors\\ndata/ttdb/lighting\\ndata/ttdb/maps\\ndata/ttdb/peds\\ndata/ttdb/props\\n